{"availability":"available","full":"HKJPN/markdown-editor","name":"markdown-editor","description":"MD//WORKS — a browser-native Markdown editor built for real work. Security first, no cloud lock-in, no learning curve. It supports live preview, English spell check (Hunspell), and importing docx file. It feels like a native app and treats AI as a co-writer, not a gimmick.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-20T09:08:31Z","updated":"2026-10-03T21:52:47Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://hkjpn.github.io/markdown-editor/**","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.822Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.822Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.822Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.822Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["100% Local, yet AI-Ready: MD//WORKS is entirely local and cloud-free. Keep your data fully secure on your device, while still leveraging your browser's native AI sidebars for seamless assistance without copy-pasting. Of course, it also offers full support for local LLMs.","Deep Edit Mode - Your editing, remembered: Not just what you wrote, but what you deleted. Batches typing every 5 seconds, tracks large deletions, pastes, replace-all, and formatting with heading context. 500 events max, memory-only, never sent, Base64 omitted. The DEEP badge glows quietly while it listens. You can also leverage AI to analyze your editing process from an objective, third-person perspective (Planned for v1.6.1 or later). For more information about AI integration, see \"11. AI-Assisted Writing\" in the manual.","Choose a theme based on your working environment: Midnight for focused editing, Paper for reviewing, and Warm for long writing sessions."],"features":["Bring Word documents directly into your Markdown workflow.","UI: Accessible via File › Import Word.","Imports headings, paragraphs, lists, and simple tables","Converts Word content into editable Markdown","Handles complex tables and shapes as readable placeholders"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKJPN/markdown-editor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0a32c1f416060a9d3c6c0098018ee43df62d8a6f538e440484d40555639ff0fa","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:10.274Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.943Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"100% Local, yet AI-Ready: MD//WORKS is entirely local and cloud-free. Keep your data fully secure on your device, while still leveraging your browser's native AI sidebars for seamless assistance without copy-pasting. Of course, it also offers full support for local LLMs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKJPN/markdown-editor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0a32c1f416060a9d3c6c0098018ee43df62d8a6f538e440484d40555639ff0fa","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKJPN/markdown-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.944Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T21:52:47Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.822Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKJPN/markdown-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.946Z","hash":"0a32c1f416060a9d3c6c0098018ee43df62d8a6f538e440484d40555639ff0fa","originalBytes":17744,"storedBytes":17744,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["works","markdown","file","writing","browser","editing","editor","document","files","text","via","app","code","mode","preview","restricted","viewer","when","while","directly","documents","html","open","standalone","word","ai-assisted","documents.","environments","history","instantly","local","pwa","support","supported","yes","after","any","browsers","clean","deep","docs","edit","english","export","full","fully","installation","knowledge","notes","offline","replace","standard","tools","what","who","without","accessible","allowed","automatically","available","data","designed","d